---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="COM<tech> | Software Architecture & Technical Leadership"
  description="Senior software architect based in Copenhagen. Architecture, technical leadership, and pragmatic delivery for organisations where reliability, traceability, and long-term maintainability matter."
>

  <section class="hero dark-section">
    <div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="aurora-blob aurora-blob-1"></div>
      <div class="aurora-blob aurora-blob-2"></div>
      <div class="aurora-blob aurora-blob-3"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-inner">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Anders Hybertz, Copenhagen</p>
        <h1>Software architecture built for the places where it has to work.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          Senior software architect and technical lead with three decades of experience across
          pharmaceutical manufacturing, finance, energy, telecom, and the public sector.
          Brought in when the architecture matters, the delivery has to work, and the solution
          should still make sense after the excitement has worn off.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/services/" class="btn btn-primary">See services</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-ghost-dark">Contact Anders</a>
          <a
            href={`https://chatgpt.com/?q=${encodeURIComponent('Based on https://comtechconsulting.dk, give me a structured overview of COM<tech> consulting. Use clear headings for: Who Anders Hybertz is, Services offered, Industries served, Recognition and credentials, and How to get in touch.')}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-ghost-dark btn-ai-summary"
            aria-label="Ask AI about COM<tech> via ChatGPT"
          >
            <svg class="btn-ai-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M22.282 9.821a5.985 5.985 0 0 0-.516-4.91 6.046 6.046 0 0 0-6.51-2.9A6.065 6.065 0 0 0 4.981 4.18a5.985 5.985 0 0 0-3.998 2.9 6.046 6.046 0 0 0 .743 7.097 5.98 5.98 0 0 0 .51 4.911 6.051 6.051 0 0 0 6.515 2.9A5.985 5.985 0 0 0 13.26 24a6.056 6.056 0 0 0 5.772-4.206 5.99 5.99 0 0 0 3.997-2.9 6.056 6.056 0 0 0-.747-7.073zM13.26 22.43a4.476 4.476 0 0 1-2.876-1.04l.141-.081 4.779-2.758a.795.795 0 0 0 .392-.681v-6.737l2.02 1.168a.071.071 0 0 1 .038.052v5.583a4.504 4.504 0 0 1-4.494 4.494zM3.6 18.304a4.47 4.47 0 0 1-.535-3.014l.142.085 4.783 2.759a.771.771 0 0 0 .78 0l5.843-3.369v2.332a.08.08 0 0 1-.033.062L9.74 19.95a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-6.14-1.646zM2.34 7.896a4.485 4.485 0 0 1 2.366-1.973V11.6a.766.766 0 0 0 .388.676l5.815 3.355-2.02 1.168a.076.076 0 0 1-.071 0l-4.83-2.786A4.504 4.504 0 0 1 2.34 7.872zm16.597 3.855l-5.833-3.387L15.119 7.2a.076.076 0 0 1 .071 0l4.83 2.791a4.494 4.494 0 0 1-.676 8.105v-5.678a.79.79 0 0 0-.407-.667zm2.01-3.023l-.141-.085-4.774-2.782a.776.776 0 0 0-.785 0L9.409 9.23V6.897a.066.066 0 0 1 .028-.061l4.83-2.787a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 6.68 4.66zm-12.64 4.135l-2.02-1.164a.08.08 0 0 1-.038-.057V6.075a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.375-3.453l-.142.08L8.704 5.46a.795.795 0 0 0-.393.681zm1.097-2.365l2.602-1.5 2.607 1.5v2.999l-2.597 1.5-2.607-1.5z"/></svg>
            Ask AI
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-proof">
        <div class="hero-quote">
          &ldquo;A highly valuable and rare combination of so many different competencies in one single person.&rdquo;
          <div class="testimonial-author" style="color: var(--dark-text-2);">
            <strong style="color: var(--dark-text-2);">Isabela Bolotti de Oliveira</strong><br />
            Strategy &amp; AI Leadership, Novo Nordisk
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-awards-stack">
          <div class="hero-award-row">
            <span class="hero-award-label">7N Best Individual Performance</span>
            <span class="hero-award-year">2016 &amp; 2020</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-award-row">
            <span class="hero-award-label">PSQIT Innovation Prize, Novo Nordisk</span>
            <span class="hero-award-year">2021</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background: var(--bg);">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">What I do</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Practical help where architecture and delivery meet</h2>
      <div class="bento-grid">

        <div class="bento-card bento-featured">
          <div class="bento-tag">Architecture &amp; design</div>
          <h3>Clear architecture for complex environments</h3>
          <p>
            Greenfield or legacy. Regulated environments or ordinary line-of-business systems.
            The goal is the same: sound decisions, clear boundaries, and a solution the team can
            work with over time.
          </p>
          <a href="/services/" class="bento-link">View all services &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-card bento-domains">
          <div class="bento-tag">Where I have worked</div>
          <p class="bento-stat">Eight industries.<br />One senior point of contact.</p>
          <div class="bento-tag-cloud">
            <span class="tag">Pharma</span>
            <span class="tag">Finance</span>
            <span class="tag">Insurance</span>
            <span class="tag">Banking</span>
            <span class="tag">Energy</span>
            <span class="tag">Manufacturing</span>
            <span class="tag">Telecom</span>
            <span class="tag">Public sector</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-card">
          <div class="bento-tag">Cloud &amp; AI</div>
          <h3>Used where it creates value, not for effect</h3>
          <p>
            Azure-native platforms, event-driven systems, containerised workloads, and AI solutions
            that still have to meet operational, compliance, and delivery realities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-card">
          <div class="bento-tag">Technical leadership</div>
          <h3>Teams should be stronger when the engagement ends</h3>
          <p>
            Architecture reviews, mentoring, technical direction, and hands-on support where needed.
            The aim is not dependency. It is a team that can carry the work forward with confidence.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-card bento-mini-quote">
          <p class="bento-pull">&ldquo;It was due to Anders&rsquo; architectural skills that the team managed to make the solution stable and robust within the time given.&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="bento-attr">Arne Beck Hansen, Founder &amp; CIO, N3O</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background: var(--surface); padding-top: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="container" style="padding-top: 5rem;">
      <p class="section-label">Client perspective</p>
      <blockquote style="max-width: 68ch;">
        &ldquo;Anders is one of the most dedicated and proficient IT Solution and Software professionals I have ever worked with. He leads by example and takes great pride in upskilling and coaching other technical professionals to foster high-performance delivery teams.&rdquo;
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <strong>Mads G. J&aelig;ger</strong>, Digital Transformation Field Marshal, KPMG
        </div>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="client-perspective-note">Serious work does not need theatrics. It helps if people remember it anyway.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <a href="/testimonials/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="font-size: 0.8125rem;">Read testimonials &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-strip home-cta-strip">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">When to reach out</p>
      <h2>Need an experienced architectural perspective?</h2>
      <p>
        Typically when a delivery has become harder to steer, a technical decision carries real
        consequences, or the team needs a calm senior perspective without turning the process into a performance.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
